  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Elaine Felos Ostrander</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3803 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-ma tag-meet-the-artist tag-red-sox tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3803\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/june-2-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"320\" height=\"220\" alt=\"Red Sox Wive’s Cookbook: Crowding The Plate. Cover image by Elaine Felos Ostrander\" src=\"/media/archive/d04c577147f4d2aec8136e30bcd6cd7ddeb19707992fbd7089c2e31f2e57770b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/june-2-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">June 2 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-18T03:19:53-04:00\" title=\"Friday, May 18, 2018, 3:19 am\">May 18, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet an artist with a sports interest and specialty in painting teams such as the Boston Red Sox that capture the excitement of their events. Elaine Felos Ostrander will do a <a href=\"/news/june-2-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3761 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-artweekma tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-doris-mee tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-robin-litwin tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"A blank white image.\" src=\"/media/archive/756fb9062dc3b8319cf9143d170258ae733c4c39396c5a3879bbaaf72f244534.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-01T01:21:11-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 1, 2018, 1:21 am\">May 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>At the Guild meeting on April 21, members voted and approved of by-law changes which included: Guild membership is expanded to include residents or taxpayers of Barnstable County A “quorum” <a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3752 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-toast-of-harwich tag-wequassett\" id=\"post-3752\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"838\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a group of people dancing.\" src=\"/media/archive/59b43ea8321581b0f324b9fe4ddc1f86e86ddc9a01e1cae6a4b86841c7a75479.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" rel=\"bookmark\">17th Annual Toast of Harwich</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-28T22:23:24-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 28, 2018, 10:23 pm\">April 28, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The 17th Annual Toast of Harwich was held Friday, April 27 at the Wequassett Resort &amp; Golf Club. It was a very busy night with music, lots of food and <a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3741 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-news tag-artweekma tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3741\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A group of people playing music.\" src=\"/media/archive/8dc63b26c7b4a7f866cf24d2fb46053b9dae5dd33b8fc2c612bb40d8b35e92e0.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Members Play for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-26T11:22:23-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, April 26, 2018, 11:22 am\">April 26, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Saturday morning, April 28th, Guild members Carroll Sivco and Elaine Felos Ostrander are members of the Cape Cod Ukulele Club will be performing at 11 Am in the new Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3684 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-andrew-kusmin tag-artweek tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-kathleen-magnusson tag-larry-folding tag-lydia-bell tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-yvette-stenzel\" id=\"post-3684\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman painting with watercolors at a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/00421df83ff95b315a4308f2588b50a921d82bd450400bc624f11b2de9128f5b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">April Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-03T01:06:43-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, April 3, 2018, 1:06 am\">April 3, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>April Meetings: Executive Board Meeting:  Monday, April 9, 2018, 9:30a.m. at Harwich Chamber of Commerce Board Room, 1 Schoolhouse Road, Harwich Port Gallery Meeting:  Saturday, April 21, 2018, 12:30 p.m <a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3339 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-events category-news tag-barbara-quinn-grasso tag-chris-banks tag-dib-carlson tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-conservation-trust tag-john-glass tag-larry-folding tag-maryrose-reynolds tag-peg-masce tag-weedie-tyldesley\" id=\"post-3339\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/beautiful-weather-for-the-5th-annual-harwich-conservation-trust-wildlands-music-art-stroll/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"919\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A man with a easel in front of a tent.\" src=\"/media/archive/f38fa2eb4a26f4ecc8c16a96e7658261dddafe2f7c2b6f8bbf690f92fde1a7ef.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/beautiful-weather-for-the-5th-annual-harwich-conservation-trust-wildlands-music-art-stroll/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Beautiful Weather for the 5th Annual Harwich Conservation Trust Wildlands Music &amp; Art Stroll</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-09-14T00:49:35-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, September 14, 2017, 12:49 am\">September 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigat